      "texts": {
        "en": "We follow the crowds to the Ansidei Madonna. It is very large – perhaps 5 by 7 feet. Through the formidable locked and barred window, we see an arch going to a window in the Haymarket Theatre. A warden tells us only the Head Warden has access to the window keys."
